	(text "Comb x = 11...51, y = 12.5...17.5; RX strip y = 10.6...11.8 (SPEC §2.1). Bottom mask open over both.\nGuard GND around the RX strip and the CAP_EL_RX trace on all layers; nothing else on the bottom in y = 9...19."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 66.04 0)
		(effects
